[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5401.11, "timestamp": "01:30:01", "text": "向上。杰西。呃，杰西，你秃顶了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5405.27, "timestamp": "01:30:05", "text": "杰西，我没秃顶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5409.59, "timestamp": "01:30:09", "text": "去他妈的杰西。这是征兆，贱人。呃，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5415.51, "timestamp": "01:30:15", "text": "杰西。这是男性型脱发。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5420.39, "timestamp": "01:30:20", "text": "呃，去你的。去你的，老爸。我 我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5426.95, "timestamp": "01:30:26", "text": "你父亲。糟糕。嗯嗯。操"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5429.189, "timestamp": "01:30:29", "text": "真他妈令人失望。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5431.709, "timestamp": "01:30:31", "text": "不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5434.95, "timestamp": "01:30:34", "text": "哦，糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5437.03, "timestamp": "01:30:37", "text": "不，你是秃顶了。看着我。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5439.91, "timestamp": "01:30:39", "text": "浓密秀发。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5442.07, "timestamp": "01:30:42", "text": "好了，各位。我明白了，你明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5444.95, "timestamp": "01:30:44", "text": "东西，婊子。这也如何呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5449.669, "timestamp": "01:30:49", "text": "即将结束吗？哦好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5451.59, "timestamp": "01:30:51", "text": "呃，如果我们能拿到钱，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5454.47, "timestamp": "01:30:54", "text": "它喜欢我们平分这笔钱吗？呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5458.39, "timestamp": "01:30:58", "text": "银行是共享的。哦好的。我是哦，"}]